@title Cabinet plate: EMC view with the magnetic field estimate (25 A drive, three phases, PLC beside it)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Ctrl+K "EMC view on the plate": the exposure map is the field slice of the drawn currents (model), the legend names its ends in microtesla, and the PLC next to the drive has a numbered hot spot.
open qa/fixtures/emc-field.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
shot plate-field-overview
check_layout
click_text "Exposure map" #1
wait 15
expect "Magnetic field of the drawn currents"
expect "a model"
shot plate-field-map
check_layout
click_text "Field at sensitive device" #1
wait 15
expect "Field at the device"
expect "Estimate"
shot plate-field-card
check_layout
